{
  "engine": "chatterbox",
  "clips": [
    {
      "text": "\"Stay in.\" She's the one out there, and she's telling me to stay in.",
      "mood": "shaken",
      "category": "pages",
      "file": "4ee2ce4a0c98cb4bbd66fae92518b993f2bcd09d112b2e3e36db6b31b617f4c9.wav",
      "seconds": 3.534708333333333,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7956345677375793,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "shaken.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Two cups. She packed for both of us. She knew I'd come.",
      "mood": "breaking",
      "category": "pages",
      "file": "17fd7082c4f7d17491c36ede7b844c02fd7139b0c22d29d26fce2d39e9d4e28e.wav",
      "seconds": 3.6438333333333333,
      "wer": 0.08333333333333333,
      "similarity": 0.7279603481292725,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "breaking.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then I heard it again, from the trees. Okay. I won't answer. I won't.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "pages",
      "file": "a050137b5cf807934b4c3d94bca70c37745dd7cc1df5a693b3c6b777ce75945b.wav",
      "seconds": 7.992791666666666,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7681047916412354,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "hushed.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prints that just stop. She's describing mine. I haven't been to the pines yet. Have I?",
      "mood": "shaken",
      "category": "pages",
      "file": "e2838a94d1ceca6231ed9b9cee94000818cb0b560e858d6ef736c9c73237298c.wav",
      "seconds": 4.582208333333333,
      "wer": 0.125,
      "similarity": 0.7786985039710999,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "shaken.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "That's my handwriting. That's how I make my M's.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "pages",
      "file": "b610104be3f855bcdd85aab03852fbd742258be7d8b70184ce3c6a4a3e90cba4.wav",
      "seconds": 5.258041666666666,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8057153224945068,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "hushed.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Don't turn around. Fine. I won't. Just be at the lights.",
      "mood": "resolve",
      "category": "pages",
      "file": "eff959d41255497ab7c465b57cd97801a32704b87a4b9974af6307fc9daf83b1.wav",
      "seconds": 4.145458333333333,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8133813142776489,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "resolve.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "One cup. Just one. I'm not lifting that sheet. I'm not.",
      "mood": "breaking",
      "category": "pages",
      "file": "03742d079929e91ac272576277f7314d30bffcee608af94b844d96e2d92e0f33.wav",
      "seconds": 4.8617083333333335,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7879486680030823,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "breaking.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "She left the door open for me. Or for herself. She never could decide which of us needed rescuing.",
      "mood": "warm",
      "category": "deciphered",
      "file": "b27040aa1e8fbde58747f6aec660c82bd38074e4321893f71cd597342aba5e3c.wav",
      "seconds": 7.71175,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8195181488990784,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "warm.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "One cup. The intake said one cup. I'm not counting again. I'm not.",
      "mood": "breaking",
      "category": "deciphered",
      "file": "b47fd982e0f5d888ee18738b3c3d2f862e63a0d45342aaff1875955f027ed888.wav",
      "seconds": 5.51525,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7581914663314819,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "breaking.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "It used my name on her. And she answered to it. ...So would I.",
      "mood": "shaken",
      "category": "deciphered",
      "file": "f588d841b7f5891a25da01ed94de9dbd1cce6dca1b97d00eced6d10f8dde725c.wav",
      "seconds": 3.6574583333333335,
      "wer": 0.07142857142857142,
      "similarity": 0.7984463572502136,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "shaken.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Smaller than mine. Then not. Like the prints were growing into me.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "deciphered",
      "file": "4382ee932249f921da433ece3a999976f2328b724a9ac4db0ce00c6da27e0b5f.wav",
      "seconds": 7.7065,
      "wer": 0.08333333333333333,
      "similarity": 0.8291547894477844,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "hushed.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Same hand, both pages. I'd know it anywhere. That's what scares me.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "deciphered",
      "file": "fd318cd6d9045730e559cfa4daae174b9a82d08aa96558beca681645d313d08a.wav",
      "seconds": 8.570958333333333,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8231101036071777,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "hushed.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "The sheet is the coat. Just the coat. Say it again. ...The sheet is the coat.",
      "mood": "resolve",
      "category": "deciphered",
      "file": "f8e12cd8890029391a7a9ccc6530e6099d30c60ab2d9d988af4fe64a69b22b05.wav",
      "seconds": 4.612291666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.6233838796615601,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "resolve.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coat held its shape. Nobody was in it. ...Nobody was ever in it.",
      "mood": "numb",
      "category": "deciphered",
      "file": "bcdd2cb64e535fabf4a850b21ff4595f640b9ac5f3fb32a07d1a1df7ab41dd43.wav",
      "seconds": 6.500958333333333,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8404399752616882,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "numb.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Her side of the bed is still warm. She can't be far.",
      "mood": "warm",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "a5c5be2903354ea774e21ed3533775ceece4c291cf59f2f4abf79e5048eee652.wav",
      "seconds": 3.1976666666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7465183734893799,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "warm.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Her boots are gone. The door isn't even latched.",
      "mood": "shaken",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "d5a5327d362a462c33a90261a06e05bd6bcd82079ab3e07686c617b624b8ff84.wav",
      "seconds": 2.40125,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7552018761634827,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "shaken.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Two chairs pulled out. She sat up with that candle until it went out.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "99c5b1fd555b9c2b29cbc059875ee7ca89a5359ce4cfc400d8878454a6c17e87.wav",
      "seconds": 6.276291666666666,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8202160596847534,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "hushed.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mathilda? She wouldn't go down there. She hates the cellar.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "19612fc3409ad87562bc8121351898fe5fff4af43e757983a120da2288360018.wav",
      "seconds": 6.794625,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8303313851356506,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "hushed.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "If she's down here, she's been quiet a long time.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "2580683fd1faac2be239ee99b6004d9b8204f7df2016f03fd416457e2bd1e674.wav",
      "seconds": 4.963333333333333,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8021095991134644,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "hushed.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "No wind down here. Just my heart, and I wish it would slow down.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "ce080064281c999fce20e459e92a3ead625dbd0aec632a2efa4bd8bb60cd895c.wav",
      "seconds": 6.183375,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8114768266677856,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "hushed.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Why does a cabin need a hallway this long under the ground?",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "8119c52ffc83b4e3d1c7380db60b2f594b4a261989575895e0f6085210bc75e8.wav",
      "seconds": 4.749125,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8316055536270142,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "hushed.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Someone keeps this place clean. Someone expects to use it.",
      "mood": "shaken",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "83459668a44711c6cdd0ab9ab17768cfdb3abfe2be01d7b1ef459fedda5ffcf8.wav",
      "seconds": 3.4305416666666666,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7519354224205017,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "shaken.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "No. She wouldn't be here. She's out in the snow. She has to be.",
      "mood": "breaking",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "eff4e0956f1c832306c3b05ca7c98fc395a7018d4abf42973e8cf97296896afa.wav",
      "seconds": 4.200375,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7595022916793823,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "breaking.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Her prints are already filling in. I have to be faster than the snow.",
      "mood": "resolve",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "b5ce26d23d18a359f28f79ff1efc4cf082b7b747459d174259b972a0b2c93143.wav",
      "seconds": 3.882791666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7246466875076294,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "resolve.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Headlights. Someone's waiting. Please let it be her.",
      "mood": "breaking",
      "category": "places",
      "file": "a6ef5b81bd0803955edb6bed215f57bc823a0c063fdd7411499cb377d313add8.wav",
      "seconds": 3.8143333333333334,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7238978147506714,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "breaking.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "The lantern's still lit. Nobody's been here. Or I have, and I don't remember.",
      "mood": "shaken",
      "category": "revisits",
      "file": "5fd10dd8893dd93332a1d21a4d93f462b6c4d8d1dca590e58f07ce4f7b21cdbb.wav",
      "seconds": 4.900916666666666,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8056721687316895,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "shaken.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "I latched it behind me. I know I did.",
      "mood": "shaken",
      "category": "revisits",
      "file": "1b274e9d06f94b643f616205fccedf9ce8636b9b401ad48442c45a395abf782a.wav",
      "seconds": 2.132791666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7954449653625488,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "shaken.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Still two chairs. I keep thinking one of them will be pushed in.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "revisits",
      "file": "a8c1ad6f6cc15c1902b39116fa3bccf373b82ed34790bb3fa2281221b7fc9748.wav",
      "seconds": 5.624041666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.831391453742981,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "hushed.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "I said I wouldn't come back down here. I keep coming back down here.",
      "mood": "breaking",
      "category": "revisits",
      "file": "fa224de6b980c81ab9cf1b96a8763cab9d14918c6dec20fdbb664ff2a5f2eedb.wav",
      "seconds": 3.419625,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7826728820800781,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "breaking.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Every set of prints out here could be mine.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "revisits",
      "file": "4fb9326d1f4929a96f1db5a54583c05932e26cd3a513096c875215296eabf76f.wav",
      "seconds": 3.664041666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8319661617279053,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "hushed.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Still only goes down. I keep hoping there'll be a back door this time.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "revisits",
      "file": "6d12e0db0e03ba69243d152fbdb7506bd58d1837c4d5e2582c95fd349967ec14.wav",
      "seconds": 5.987541666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8674368858337402,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "hushed.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Back down here. Like something in me keeps choosing it.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "revisits",
      "file": "8915ef11b596494d3b79673182795c86af98b054d770e362c84067396e3611ee.wav",
      "seconds": 5.256166666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8103710412979126,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "hushed.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Same hallway. Same hum. You'd think I'd stop being scared of a hallway.",
      "mood": "wry",
      "category": "revisits",
      "file": "5f7393ff8092576aeb3136c0d30693011ed189aedc0f6878ad265ed874516df0.wav",
      "seconds": 4.117125,
      "wer": 0.07692307692307693,
      "similarity": 0.8088170289993286,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "wry.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Clean again. Who cleans up after a thing like this? Who does that?",
      "mood": "bitter",
      "category": "revisits",
      "file": "fcef5a6120c0394b917ac6fc5db4eb5cbffeb9c15f40e5195f73be8b313bcefa.wav",
      "seconds": 4.064625,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8153629302978516,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "bitter.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Still running. Still waiting. Please still be waiting.",
      "mood": "pleading",
      "category": "revisits",
      "file": "4207ffcac1ac35d6db6a7f29fccb11c021508d370ea1581ef6fb62df39f5cca3.wav",
      "seconds": 6.2683333333333335,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.783816933631897,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "pleading.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mathilda? Please get in. I'll drive. You can pick the music. Just... get in.",
      "mood": "pleading",
      "category": "endings",
      "file": "f4738f7e7c315bea47a3a8022750ad5ae3fd9058f8dc055c8e56d9959002ca2f.wav",
      "seconds": 8.007291666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.826240062713623,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "pleading.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry I sent you out there alone. ...Come on. Let's go home.",
      "mood": "breaking",
      "category": "endings",
      "file": "a30533911dae0a50f3a0505e71d3bac193f6d20dfbf3fd0b65eb447eeffcd364.wav",
      "seconds": 4.1015,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7911175489425659,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "breaking.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Go, then!",
      "mood": "bitter",
      "category": "answers",
      "file": "89f4ecc97da2d55a7b49230eb91128deb8342917e88e8cb795ab5095df04f414.wav",
      "seconds": 1.332875,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.4538521468639374,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "bitter.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm right behind you.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "answers",
      "file": "e978d6ce48fa017b0ff0aa101f3d287afa461c8509f428c4985ca60db2932a19.wav",
      "seconds": 1.5580416666666668,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.6990236639976501,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "hushed.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "She knows this field better than I do. She'll have found shelter.",
      "mood": "steady",
      "category": "bored",
      "file": "b73ce488353d30f9700cfcb68a3bddda338c7c651548f71ef2388479bc414b5e.wav",
      "seconds": 3.8260833333333335,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8095052242279053,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "steady.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ten minutes, she said. Ten minutes, and then the snow came in sideways.",
      "mood": "shaken",
      "category": "bored",
      "file": "c6043abf83185a9f533e7342851cffeae8fff53630c07b7ce3f8c802819b8d41.wav",
      "seconds": 5.304708333333333,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.795245885848999,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "shaken.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "When I find her I'm going to be so angry. And then I'm not letting go.",
      "mood": "warm",
      "category": "bored",
      "file": "88b4833a7e0d5277b5f007d0dca0d9fda8d053eba760d512e01b1bac58b73320.wav",
      "seconds": 6.189916666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8740401864051819,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "warm.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "She always leaves something behind so I can find her. Always.",
      "mood": "steady",
      "category": "bored",
      "file": "a7ccc165f5f586681af631a5666cff4029d6cf3adde380639738c269aba774e5.wav",
      "seconds": 3.496125,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8213406801223755,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "steady.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Every white shape is her coat, until it isn't.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "bored",
      "file": "901094d9bf3eb2fea9ec44f9754f73a0d77988bf74a386f3e7a70edb68e954f3.wav",
      "seconds": 4.685416666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8338954448699951,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "hushed.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "She'll be cold. She never wears the hat. I should've made her wear the hat.",
      "mood": "warm",
      "category": "bored",
      "file": "5f12acf3e2198dde57dded240dce208c52e61ee0883b736690c8bff1a68d7624.wav",
      "seconds": 5.2595,
      "wer": 0.13333333333333333,
      "similarity": 0.7993592619895935,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "warm.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "If she's sitting in some hunting hut eating my chocolate, I swear to God.",
      "mood": "wry",
      "category": "bored",
      "file": "f9ba5926cf1e416961703fce9c1ea05770950e3d3a2c64f0c86bb8d87edc88b0.wav",
      "seconds": 3.676041666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8337525725364685,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "wry.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "She hums when she's cold. Badly. I'd give anything to hear it now.",
      "mood": "remembering",
      "category": "bored",
      "file": "157c886b9af11cb35f4ead966379fe83c37c00fc3b5e25aa46842b03763b125a.wav",
      "seconds": 5.2374583333333335,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8940748572349548,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "remembering.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay. Think. If I were her, where would I go? ...Exactly where I told her not to.",
      "mood": "steady",
      "category": "bored",
      "file": "3ea5b123aa2eb66079f476618b704729f082450694470b89a98c44e46f9c1857.wav",
      "seconds": 5.585666666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8431453704833984,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "steady.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Go, then.\" Great. Brilliant. Best thing I've ever said.",
      "mood": "bitter",
      "category": "bored",
      "file": "d7b7f3cb79893aa09894ce4c1e87d283f4786bf14a7b0cc553c4032b45ae6c74.wav",
      "seconds": 4.779916666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8313482999801636,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "bitter.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Her prints stop. Mine don't. What does that make me?",
      "mood": "shaken",
      "category": "bored",
      "file": "6110d9c021d005ff240631ba75af1d9b52f07a9a10ec35bd1cc56802b6689189.wav",
      "seconds": 3.0414583333333334,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8084515929222107,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "shaken.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "I've said her name so many times it's just a sound now.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "bored",
      "file": "d3e2f9096d837b18e7dcf126e55633e705d93884b08cf5f5619883dd9a463f7f.wav",
      "seconds": 5.206958333333334,
      "wer": 0.08333333333333333,
      "similarity": 0.7969384789466858,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "hushed.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "What if she's back at the cabin, by the lantern, writing to me?",
      "mood": "shaken",
      "category": "bored",
      "file": "2b8bea5c79ea6ac277fe7fcb629eba1442857abddcb31d61e7db62dcaa08ae4d.wav",
      "seconds": 2.897,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8332183361053467,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "shaken.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "I can't remember which of us said we'd stay.",
      "mood": "breaking",
      "category": "bored",
      "file": "2d310a5fa3a38b7f70e7832a2199836b68ff6ab0d4bcda5494045ae2a3f7e7f4.wav",
      "seconds": 2.9066666666666667,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7975698709487915,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "breaking.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "I keep turning to tell her something. There's nobody to tell.",
      "mood": "breaking",
      "category": "bored",
      "file": "e1003ca31612399ec60bed7903cd5074ecbee5682046ac299f4764aa80f0a92c.wav",
      "seconds": 3.7836666666666665,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.7438775300979614,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "breaking.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "The light hasn't moved. She was right. It's the same afternoon.",
      "mood": "hushed",
      "category": "bored",
      "file": "d4ae4f150e2c90d4edc11837535c2bba5042a2c8a7c029b876192199481456ca.wav",
      "seconds": 5.492333333333334,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.798539400100708,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "hushed.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "My feet stopped hurting a while ago. I'm choosing not to think about that.",
      "mood": "numb",
      "category": "bored",
      "file": "caaf76ecff58df4a3ff8061cde56f7fbd780790d850a91147305831f594e11f2.wav",
      "seconds": 4.946,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8909067511558533,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "numb.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sometimes I hear her footsteps right behind mine. Exactly in time. Exactly.",
      "mood": "shaken",
      "category": "bored",
      "file": "674a402be2cfefa33198c8cf1a2f2e0c9bebedd6831071afc7338e3095dccc8b.wav",
      "seconds": 5.211333333333333,
      "wer": 0.0,
      "similarity": 0.8019209504127502,
      "engine": "chatterbox",
      "reference": "shaken.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "She always got to be the brave one. I got to be the one who waited. Who decided that?",
      "mood": "bitter",
      "category": "bored",
      "file": "076209f59805875d1894d5b3f6fd50bc0cb69be408142f7990486b993803e8d0.wav",
